{"articleNo":"70656","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=70656&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[창업교육센터] UCC경진대회 상장 수령 공지","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.11.27","hit":"3385","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">안녕하세요</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">창업교육센터입니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지난 번 창업교육센터에서 치뤄진 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">UCC </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">경진대회에 참가하여 입상한 학생들은 상장을 수령해 가시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">팀대표뿐만 아니라 팀원들도 개별로 상장을 발급해 드리니 창업교육센터 행정실</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이오스관 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">313</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">호</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">로 와서 직접 수령해 가시길 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">시상식을 따로 개최하려고 했으나 여러 가지 센터 사정으로 인해 개별 수령을 하게 된 점과 상장 수령이 많이 늦어진 점에 대해 양해 부탁드립니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">금오공과대학교 창업교육센터장</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">*</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">담당자 문의처 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 054-478-6948</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETT